  "body": "PR #1097 (#1094) adds the MCP tool `set_raw_stock_only` (marks a from-model stock's source model as raw stock only, one undoable step, same command as the stock page's checkbox). The camcraft-mcp skill (`.claude/skills/camcraft-mcp/SKILL.md`) has no row for it.\n\nProcess file: its own small PR with a `.claude/PROCESS_VERSION` bump, opened only after PR #1097 merges, so the table never names a tool main does not have; announce on #681. Can be folded into the same PR as #1059 / #1084.\n\nDone means: the row (parameters, undo note, that an operation naming the model puts it back in the verdict, and that the post is refused when nothing is left to judge) is in the skill table; PROCESS_VERSION bumped; #681 announced on merge.",
